From 584e5835843b6a2b4feeda460fccc0f66ab7f78a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Lantwin <oliver.lantwin@cern.ch>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:14:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: link GeoMaterial2G4 explicitly

VolumeBuilder.h from GeoModel2G4 constructs a Geo2G4MaterialFactory
inline, but GeoModel2G4 links GeoMaterial2G4 only privately. On Linux
the library still gets loaded, but Apple's linker failed with an
undefined Geo2G4MaterialFactory constructor. Link GeoMaterial2G4
directly.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 26498cd..17c4175 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -102,6 +102,9 @@ target_link_libraries(
         GeoModelIO::GeoModelDBManager
         GeoModelIO::GeoModelRead
         GeoModel2G4
+        # GeoModel2G4's VolumeBuilder.h constructs a Geo2G4MaterialFactory
+        # inline, but GeoModel2G4 links GeoMaterial2G4 only privately.
+        GeoMaterial2G4
 )
 
 # ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
